(1. What This Software Does) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This software is a Windows desktop application built with Qt Widgets and C++. It manages) Tj
T*
(warehouse SKU master data, generates QR-coded serial labels, tracks historical QR records,) Tj
T*
(exports operational reports, and protects sensitive actions with user roles, audit logging,) Tj
T*
(and backup workflows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The application is intended for warehouse and inventory teams that need one tool for product) Tj
T*
(master data and outgoing or incoming QR label generation. The software is not a web service.) Tj
T*
(It is a local desktop app backed by an SQLite database.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. Core Business Purpose) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The software solves two connected problems.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(First, it maintains a structured product catalog where each item gets a computed SKU based) Tj
T*
(on category rules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Second, it generates unique QR label values for those SKUs so the warehouse can print) Tj
T*
(stickers, track serial creation over time, and review or correct historical serial records) Tj
T*
(later.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Main Functional Areas) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Dashboard: shows top-level counts such as total SKUs, total generated serials, current) Tj
T*
(quarter volume, prefix counts, and latest SKU cards.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(SKU Generation: creates and maintains the SKU master catalog. Users can search records, fill) Tj
T*
(the form from existing rows, update fields, delete SKUs, and attach product images.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(QR Code Generation: creates one or more QR serials for a selected SKU, shows the generated) Tj
T*
(values in a table, previews a QR image, and exports sticker labels to PDF.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(QR Code Manager: loads historical QR rows by SKU and serial filter, displays details, allows) Tj
T*
(controlled edit and delete actions, and can export selected history rows to sticker PDF.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Security and Administration: manages user accounts, roles, permission overrides, login,) Tj
T*
(switch-user flow, and audit logging.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Database and Backup Operations: loads an existing database, exports a database copy, saves) Tj
