T*
(authorization.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. QR Generation Workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The QR workflow begins after a valid SKU exists in the catalog.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The user selects a SKU, chooses a branding prefix, chooses quarter and year, and enters a) Tj
T*
(quantity. The supported prefixes in the current code are SD, SK, and SM.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(For each requested serial, the app computes a QR value using:) Tj
T*
(prefix + SKU + quarter + 2-digit year + serial padded to 5 digits) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The generation flow inserts rows into barcode_log, refreshes the next-serial tracker, shows) Tj
T*
(the generated table, and updates dashboard totals. The QR image preview is rendered in-app) Tj
T*
(from the generated value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This means the software is both a catalog manager and a serial label generator. The SKU) Tj
T*
(defines the product identity. The QR value defines a unique label instance for that SKU in a) Tj
T*
(given period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Sticker PDF Workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(After QR rows are generated, the user can export sticker labels to PDF.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The print path uses Qt PrintSupport and a configurable sticker layout. The print settings) Tj
T*
(dialog controls label size, QR size, margins, logo size, and element placement. The export) Tj
T*
(routine combines product details, rack and bin details, branding logo, website text, and QR) Tj
T*
(image onto each sticker label.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The same PDF export path can also be used from the history screen for selected historical) Tj
T*
(serial rows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9. QR History Workflow) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The QR Code Manager tab is the operational review screen for generated serials.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The user filters by SKU and optionally by serial text, then loads matching rows. The table) Tj
T*
(shows SKU, part name, serial, generated timestamp, QR value, quarter, and year.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(From this screen, authorized users can:) Tj
T*
(review details for an existing QR record) Tj
T*
(export selected rows to sticker PDF) Tj
T*
(edit serial, quarter, year, and date for a selected row) Tj
T*
(delete selected rows through soft delete) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Edit and delete actions require permission checks and admin re-authorization. After a) Tj
T*
(change, the app refreshes serial tracking so future generation continues from the correct) Tj
ET
