(10. Security Model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The application requires login for normal use. Passwords are stored as salted SHA-256) Tj
T*
(hashes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Base access levels are View Only, Add Data, and Full Access. The database also supports) Tj
T*
(named roles and optional user-specific permission overrides.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Important permissions include add, edit, delete SKU, serial edit, serial delete, print,) Tj
T*
(export, backup or restore, and manage users.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Sensitive actions such as deleting SKUs, deleting serial rows, and editing historical serial) Tj
T*
(rows require a second admin authorization step with a reason comment. The software logs) Tj
T*
(these actions to the audit table.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
