() Tj
T*
(CSV export for QR summary totals.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Spreadsheet export for all generated serials.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Database export or save-copy workflows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Automated encrypted backups with retention pruning and backup history tracking.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These flows make the application useful not only for daily operations but also for) Tj
T*
(reporting, traceability, and recovery.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
